  - lesion spatial logic
  - interpretable machine learning
abstract: >-
  Source code for biologically interpretable multi-scale feature engineering,
  lesion spatial descriptors, two-stage feature pruning, SVM classification,
  baseline comparisons, cross-validation, statistical analysis, segmentation
  evaluation, CNN comparison training, and computational-efficiency benchmarks
  for tomato leaf disease classification.
